  "claim_contract": {
    "proved": "For arbitrary fine U(1) links, two half-step Clifford transport exactly refines a coarse directional shift whenever the ordered two-half-edge product reconstructs the framed coarse link. The contracts are gauge invariant and compose through the full factorwise M-X-Y-Z-Y-X-M walk. Canonical exact refinement can preserve nontrivial coarse plaquette holonomy. For arbitrary one-axis half-link pairs, the adjacent-scale Hilbert defect is exactly the coarse reconstructed-link mismatch energy. A concrete flat connection with quarter-turn half-links has a nonzero refinement defect, formally refuting an unconditional curvature-only rule.",
    "not_proved": "No theorem bounds an arbitrary full Clifford-walk defect solely by face plaquettes. No complete operator-norm bound for the five straight-edge mismatches, scale-decay law, summability theorem for the concrete walk, continuum Dirac limit, dynamical gauge equation, gravity, cosmology, or empirical claim is established."
  },
